graph TD
    A[User Uploads PDF] --> B(API: POST /documents)
    B --> C[Document Service]
    C --> D{Save to Disk}
    D --> E[PyMuPDF Extractor]
    E -->|Raw Text| F[Recursive Character Chunker]
    F -->|List of Strings| G[Embedding Service]
    G -->|SentenceTransformers| H[Generate Vectors]
    H --> I[SQLAlchemy: INSERT Document]
    I --> J[SQLAlchemy: INSERT Chunks + Vectors]
    J --> K[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    K --> L[Return 200 OK]
